{"version":1,"content":"<p>陳奕迅（Eason）《Recording Sessions with Mr. Eason Chan》將於2026年12月12日（星期六）至2027年2月20日於香港演藝學院歌劇院舉行，Cityline網上登記抽籤購票今日（10月28日）上午11時開始【連結按此】。</p><p>這26場錄音演出並非一般演唱會，而是Eason將聯同樂隊，在觀眾面前重新演繹及正式錄製歷年經典專輯，讓歌迷親身走進錄音現場，見證經典歌曲重新誕生的時刻。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:10.050501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T01:48:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:18:07.504340+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:38:55.717728+00:00","content_hash":"fd68f446a2b574015a1777b46d62c2474efb33e5c0adb37c6c550d8d9fc24456","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}